  "name": "AP – Daily e2e test",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-daily-end-to-end-test",
      "name": "Note: Daily end-to-end test",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Daily end-to-end test\nEvery morning before the summary, four test emails go through the **whole pipeline**: one invoice posted straight to QuickBooks, one sent to review, one rejected, one bank-details change (fraud alert). Two OCR calls per run.\n\nTest data is kept apart (scope **e2e**): never in live figures, the touchless rate or the live review list. The **core** writes the messages, decides what may be deleted and whether the run passed. A failure sends an alert at once; the 08:00 summary shows the result.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 2100
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        -150
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-start-and-reset",
      "name": "Note: Start and reset",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Start and reset\nThe core starts a run. QuickBooks objects of earlier test postings are deleted first (sub-workflow), then the core deletes the earlier test invoices (**scope e2e only**) and writes the run's messages.",
        "height": 750,
        "width": 900
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-put-in-gmail",
      "name": "Note: Put in Gmail",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Put in Gmail\nThe messages are inserted in the mailbox (Gmail API **messages.insert**), addressed to **invoices+e2e@**: mail sent from the mailbox to its own alias may never reach the inbox. The email intake picks them up within a minute.",
        "height": 550,
        "width": 900
      },
      "position": [
        1160,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-collect-and-verify",
      "name": "Note: Collect and verify",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Collect and verify\nGmail labels read, test emails moved to the trash, QuickBooks cleaned up. The core checks status, labels, log, QuickBooks objects, the clean-up, isolation from live data and the masking of bank numbers.",
        "height": 750,
        "width": 900
      },
      "position": [
        1160,
        850
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-alert",
      "name": "Note: Alert",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## Alert\nA failed run, or one that could not finish (the step is recorded), sends the core's alert email at once to the summary's recipients.",
        "height": 550,
        "width": 660
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        1050
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
